---
/**
 * /terms/
 *
 * The load-bearing clause is section 2: we are a matching service and the
 * contract for the cleaning is between the customer and the vendor. Everything
 * about liability follows from that, so it is stated first and plainly rather
 * than buried.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { urls } from '../lib/urls';
import { meta } from '../lib/seo';
import { company } from '../lib/data';

const path = urls.terms();

const { title, description } = meta(
  'Terms of Service | HomeToClean',
  'Terms governing use of hometoclean.com. HomeToClean is a matching service and is not the provider of the cleaning services arranged through this site.',
);

const lastUpdated = 'August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path={path}
  batch={0}
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Terms of Service', path }]}
>
  <section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
    <div class="wrap-narrow py-12 sm:py-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted">
        These terms govern your use of hometoclean.com, operated by {company.entityName}
        (UEN {company.uen}), trading as {company.tradingName}.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap-narrow prose-ht py-12 text-ink-muted sm:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-card border border-brand/25 bg-brand-light/50 p-5 text-ink">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="font-semibold">The short version.</strong> {company.tradingName} is
        a matching service. We introduce you to independent cleaning vendors. We do not
        clean your home, we do not employ the cleaners, and the agreement for the cleaning
        work is between you and the vendor you choose.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p>
      By using this site or submitting an enquiry through it, you agree to these terms. If
      you do not agree, please do not use the site.
    </p>

    <h2>2. What we do, and what we do not do</h2>
    <p>
      {company.tradingName} is a <strong>matching service</strong>. We introduce households
      in Singapore to independent third-party cleaning vendors.
    </p>
    <p>We do not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>carry out cleaning work ourselves</li>
      <li>employ, supervise or direct the cleaners who attend your home</li>
      <li>set the prices that vendors quote you</li>
      <li>act as agent for you or for any vendor</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      When you accept a vendor's quote, you enter into a contract directly with that
      vendor. {company.tradingName} is not a party to it. Questions about scope, timing,
      payment, rescheduling, damage or workmanship are matters between you and the vendor.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Vendor checks, and their limits</h2>
    <p>
      We carry out checks on vendors before matching them, as described on our
      <a href={urls.vendorStandards()}>vendor standards</a> page. Those checks are made in
      good faith on the information and documents available to us at the time.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not warrant or guarantee the quality, timeliness or outcome of any work carried
      out by a vendor, and a vendor's circumstances can change after we have checked them.
      You remain responsible for satisfying yourself about any vendor before engaging them,
      and for agreeing scope and price with them directly.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Prices shown on this site</h2>
    <p>
      Prices on this site are <strong>indicative market ranges in Singapore dollars</strong>,
      compiled from published sources, and are stated before GST at
      {company.gstRatePercent}%. They are provided so you can judge whether a quote is
      reasonable.
    </p>
    <p>
      They are <strong>not quotations and not offers</strong>. They do not bind us or any
      vendor. Your actual price comes from the vendor, after they have understood your
      home and what you need. Market rates change, and a range that is accurate today may
      not be in six months.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Enquiries and your details</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit an enquiry and give consent, we pass your details to the vendors
      matched to your request so they can quote you. Your enquiry may go to more than one
      vendor. How we handle your data is set out in our
      <a href={urls.privacy()}>Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      You agree that the information you give us is accurate, and that you are enquiring on
      your own behalf or with the authority of the person you are enquiring for.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>submit false, misleading or automated enquiries</li>
      <li>use the site for any unlawful purpose</li>
      <li>attempt to interfere with, probe or disrupt the site or its infrastructure</li>
      <li>scrape, copy or republish substantial parts of the site's content without permission</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. No charge to you</h2>
    <p>
      We do not charge you for being matched with a vendor, and you are under no obligation
      to accept any quote.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The content of this site, including the text, pricing guidance and design, belongs to
      {company.entityName} unless otherwise stated. You may read and share it for personal,
      non-commercial use. You may not reproduce it commercially without our written
      permission.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      The site and its content are provided on an "as is" basis. To the fullest extent
      permitted by law, we exclude liability for any loss or damage arising from:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>your use of, or reliance on, information published on this site, including price ranges</li>
      <li>the acts or omissions of any vendor, including the quality of any cleaning work, any damage caused during it, or any failure to attend</li>
      <li>any dispute between you and a vendor</li>
      <li>the site being unavailable or containing errors</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability that cannot lawfully be excluded
      or limited, including liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, or
      for fraud.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Our enquiry form is delivered by a third-party form provider, and this site uses
      Google Analytics. We are not responsible for their content or their independent
      handling of your data.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may change these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows
      when they were last changed. Continuing to use the site after a change means you
      accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore, and the courts of Singapore have
      exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Contact</h2>
    <div class="rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-5 text-sm not-prose">
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">{company.entityName}</p>
      <p class="mt-1">trading as {company.tradingName}</p>
      <p>UEN {company.uen}</p>
      <p class="mt-2">{company.address.street} {company.address.unit}</p>
      <p>Singapore {company.address.postalCode}</p>
      <p class="mt-2">Email: {company.email}</p>
      <p>Telephone: {company.phoneDisplay}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
